@startuml
title Code - server (Hono app) @ a4993cc, v0.5.1

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "server" {
  class "Hono app" as honoApp <<default export>> {
    +use(cors())
    +get("/") : text "Hello Hono!"
    +get("/hello") : json ApiResponse
  }
}

note bottom of honoApp
  /hello constructs a literal matching ApiResponse
  (compile-time type check, non-runtime).
  Bun serves the default export's fetch.
end note

@enduml
